    "title": "CWG 2264: Memberwise copying with indeterminate value",
    "observed_status": "drafting, revision 120 dated 2026-05-31",
    "interpretation": "This is not recorded as a proven harmless compiler warning. Initializing the actual fields removes the source ambiguity and the inputs behind the eight ARM diagnostics."
